<article class="env-lemma" id="09W2">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09W2">Lemma <span data-tag="09W2">85.2.7</span>.</a> Let $f : Y \to X$ be a morphism of simplicial spaces. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (Y_ n) \ar[d] \ar[r]_{f_ n} &  \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (X_ n) \ar[d] \\  \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (Y_{Zar}) \ar[r]^{f_{Zar}} &  \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (X_{Zar}) }  \]
</div>
  <p> is a commutative diagram of topoi. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Direct from the description of pullback functors in Lemmas <a href="/tag/09VP" data-tag="09VP">85.2.4</a> and <a href="/tag/09W0" data-tag="09W0">85.2.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>